  "body": "Positioned in the heart of vibrant Long Bay Village, this beautifully presented one bedroom apartment offers an effortless coastal lifestyle with everything you need right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nLight filled open plan living flows seamlessly through full height stacking sliders to a generous covered balcony, creating the perfect space to relax or entertain year round.\r\n\r\nSet within a safe and secure boutique complex, residents enjoy secure entry access into the building, with lift access taking you directly up to your door. Complete with secure undercover parking and a storage locker, this is an ideal lock up and leave option for professionals, downsizers, singles, or investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe current owner has particularly loved the sense of safety, security, and community within the building, making it an easy and comfortable place to call home.\r\n\r\nWith cafes, eateries, New World supermarket, Long Bay Beach, and Reserve all just moments away, the location truly speaks for itself.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* One bedroom apartment in Long Bay Village\r\n* Light filled open plan living\r\n* Generous covered balcony\r\n* Secure building with ease of lift access to your front door\r\n* Secure undercover parking plus storage locker\r\n* Safe, easy care lock up and leave living\r\n* Boutique apartment complex\r\n* Walk to beach, cafes, eateries, and supermarket\r\n\r\nFor viewings please contact the agent. Access to the building is via the inner courtyard on the New World side.\r\n\r\nhttp://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG34710",
